{
  "about": "One refusal per admission code, plus the kindless catalog row: a row with no kind is model_not_extractor without detail.kind, never model_unknown and never an invented kind. Each refusal writes nothing. invalid_params and the catalog codes come from admission's own checks against catalog; the rest come from state the request alone does not show: batch_id_reuse from a recorded batch whose fields differ, account_walled from the module's own spend guard, batch_in_progress from a call holding the batch, and the last four from the call's first provider call (a 401, a 404 or Workers AI 3042, Workers AI 3036, and 5035, 5016 or 3023). image_unavailable and image_source_unavailable come from a module that declares image_reference in role.describe, resolving an item image given as a reference: the handle is unknown, expired or not this caller's, or the module that issued it did not answer. Both name the image.",
